PaperSponge <pre><code>import org.cobblestonemc.paper.plugin.api.CobblestonePaperApi;
import org.cobblestonemc.plugin.api.NavigatorSettings;

CobblestonePaperApi.tripService()
    .navigate(player, objectiveLocation, NavigatorSettings.defaults(), "Lost Lantern");
</code></pre> <pre><code>import org.cobblestonemc.sponge.plugin.api.CobblestoneSpongeApi;
import org.cobblestonemc.plugin.api.NavigatorSettings;

CobblestoneSpongeApi.tripService()
    .navigate(player, objectiveLocation, NavigatorSettings.defaults(), "Lost Lantern");
</code></pre> <p>This runs the search and starts the trip. Every trip needs a label. It names the trip in <code>/cobblestone trips</code> and in the player's trip HUD, where it is shown exactly as given. Keep it short, and make it tell your own trips apart: unlike a <code>/navigate</code> address, Cobblestone cannot shorten or disambiguate it. The label is also the trip's identity. Starting another trip for the same player with the same label replaces the first one, which suits a quest objective that moves.</p>
